# Local secrets for `wrangler dev`. Copy this file to .dev.vars (git-ignored, as are .dev.vars.<env> and .env*) and change the value.
# LIVE_KEY unlocks live supermarket search: the web app sends it in the x-live-key header
# (Ajustes > clave). Without it, chains answer from Open Prices only.
# In production set it as a secret instead: npx wrangler secret put LIVE_KEY
LIVE_KEY=cambia-esto
